 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "Why does a mosquito",
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 3,
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.4
  },
  {
   "text": "pick you",
   "w0": 4,
   "w1": 5,
   "start": 1.4,
   "end": 2.2600000000000002
  },
  {
   "text": "and ignore your friend?",
   "w0": 6,
   "w1": 9,
   "start": 2.2600000000000002,
   "end": 3.31
  },
  {
   "text": "It isn't luck.",
   "w0": 10,
   "w1": 12,
   "start": 3.73,
   "end": 4.5600000000000005
  },
  {
   "text": "In one lab test,",
   "w0": 13,
   "w1": 16,
   "start": 4.96,
   "end": 6.010000000000001
  },
  {
   "text": "a single volunteer was",
   "w0": 17,
   "w1": 20,
   "start": 6.19,
   "end": 7.48
  },
  {
   "text": "about a hundred times",
   "w0": 21,
   "w1": 24,
   "start": 7.48,
   "end": 8.69
  },
  {
   "text": "more attractive",
   "w0": 25,
   "w1": 26,
   "start": 8.69,
   "end": 9.59
  },
  {
   "text": "than the least attractive person.",
   "w0": 27,
   "w1": 31,
   "start": 9.59,
   "end": 11.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Researchers linked it",
   "w0": 32,
   "w1": 34,
   "start": 11.71,
   "end": 12.615
  },
  {
   "text": "to fatty acids on the skin.",
   "w0": 35,
   "w1": 40,
   "start": 12.615,
   "end": 14.290000000000001
  },
  {
   "text": "Bacteria help turn them",
   "w0": 41,
   "w1": 44,
   "start": 14.75,
   "end": 15.92
  },
  {
   "text": "into your personal smell.",
   "w0": 45,
   "w1": 48,
   "start": 15.92,
   "end": 17.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a 2026 study tested",
   "w0": 49,
   "w1": 53,
   "start": 17.75,
   "end": 19.764999999999997
  },
  {
   "text": "three mosquito species",
   "w0": 54,
   "w1": 56,
   "start": 19.764999999999997,
   "end": 21.165
  },
  {
   "text": "on one hundred nineteen people.",
   "w0": 57,
   "w1": 61,
   "start": 21.165,
   "end": 22.93
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody attracted all three.",
   "w0": 62,
   "w1": 65,
   "start": 23.32,
   "end": 25.029999999999998
  },
  {
   "text": "Each species wanted",
   "w0": 66,
   "w1": 68,
   "start": 25.45,
   "end": 26.549999999999997
  },
  {
   "text": "a different scent.",
   "w0": 69,
   "w1": 71,
   "start": 26.549999999999997,
   "end": 27.49
  },
  {
   "text": "So being a magnet",
   "w0": 72,
   "w1": 75,
   "start": 27.939999999999998,
   "end": 29.195
  },
  {
   "text": "depends on which mosquito",
   "w0": 76,
   "w1": 79,
   "start": 29.195,
   "end": 30.575
  },
  {
   "text": "is flying tonight.",
   "w0": 80,
